OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Strictly coach 'could lose
OL,4,Ahome' after stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a renowned ballroom
OL,7,Fdancer who needs 24/7 care after
OL,8,Fsuffering a stroke said he could be
OL,9,Fforced to sell their home to pay for
OL,10,Fthe help she needs each day.
OL,12,FJane Bullock, who coached professionals
OL,13,Ffor the BBC's Strictly Come Dancing,
OL,14,Fcollapsed at her Wolverhampton home on
OL,15,F10 August 2025, after she finished
OL,16,Fteaching a class.
OL,18,FAs a result, the once fit and healthy
OL,19,Fdancer lost half her sight and all the
OL,20,Fmovement on the left side of her body,
OL,21,Fmeaning she is often restricted to her
OL,22,Fbed.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
